      "description": "Clean, professional cards with subtle hover effects",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .sv1-wrap{padding:100px 20px;font-family:sans-serif;background:#fdfdfd;}\n                          .sv1-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;}\n                          .sv1-subtitle{color:#4a90e2;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 10px 0;}\n                          .sv1-title{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,38px);font-weight:800;color:#111;margin:0 0 60px 0;}\n                          .sv1-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:40px;text-align:left;}\n                          .sv1-card{padding:40px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);transition:0.3s;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid #f0f0f0;}\n                          @media(max-width:768px){.sv1-wrap{padding:60px 20px;} .sv1-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;} .sv1-title{margin-bottom:40px;}}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"sv1-wrap\">\n                            <div class=\"sv1-inner\">\n                                <h6 class=\"sv1-subtitle\">Our Expertise</h6>\n                                <h2 class=\"sv1-title\">High-Quality Services</h2>\n                                \n                                <div class=\"sv1-grid\">\n                                    <div class=\"sv1-card\">\n                                        <div style=\"width: 60px; height: 60px; background: #eef5ff; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 25px; color: #4a90e2; font-size: 28px;\">🎨</div>\n                                        <h3 style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #222; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">UI/UX Design</h3>\n                                        <p style=\"color: #666; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 20px 0;\">Crafting intuitive and beautiful digital experiences that delight your users and elevate your brand.</p>\n                                        <a href=\"#\" style=\"color: #4a90e2; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px;\">Learn more &rarr;</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                    \n                                    <div class=\"sv1-card\">\n                                        <div style=\"width: 60px; height: 60px; background: #fff0f0; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 25px; color: #ff5252; font-size: 28px;\">💻</div>\n                                        <h3 style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #222; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">Web Development</h3>\n                                        <p style=\"color: #666; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 20px 0;\">Building fast, scalable, and secure web applications using cutting-edge technologies.</p>\n                                        <a href=\"#\" style=\"color: #ff5252; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px;\">Learn more &rarr;</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                    \n                                    <div class=\"sv1-card\">\n                                        <div style=\"width: 60px; height: 60px; background: #f0fdf4; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 25px; color: #22c55e; font-size: 28px;\">📈</div>\n                                        <h3 style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #222; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">Digital Marketing</h3>\n                                        <p style=\"color: #666; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 20px 0;\">Driving targeted traffic and maximizing conversions through data-driven marketing strategies.</p>\n                                        <a href=\"#\" style=\"color: #22c55e; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px;\">Learn more &rarr;</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
