      "description": "Futuristic frosted glass cards on a deep dark background",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .sv2-wrap{padding:100px 20px;font-family:sans-serif;background:#0a0a0a;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}\n                          .sv2-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;z-index:1;}\n                          .sv2-title{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,42px);font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:0 0 15px 0;}\n                          .sv2-desc{color:#a1a1aa;font-size:clamp(16px,2.5vw,18px);max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;}\n                          .sv2-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:30px;}\n                          .sv2-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);padding:40px;border-radius:20px;}\n                          @media(max-width:768px){.sv2-wrap{padding:60px 20px;} .sv2-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"sv2-wrap\">\n                            <!-- Decorative background blur -->\n                            <div style=\"position: absolute; top: -100px; left: -100px; width: 400px; height: 400px; background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3); filter: blur(100px); border-radius: 50%;\"></div>\n                            <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -100px; right: -100px; width: 400px; height: 400px; background: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.3); filter: blur(100px); border-radius: 50%;\"></div>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"sv2-inner\">\n                                <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 70px;\">\n                                    <h2 class=\"sv2-title\">What We Do</h2>\n                                    <p class=\"sv2-desc\">Empowering your digital presence with state-of-the-art solutions.</p>\n                                </div>\n                                \n                                <div class=\"sv2-grid\">\n                                    <!-- Card 1 -->\n                                    <div class=\"sv2-card\">\n                                        <div style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #a855f7); border-radius: 14px; margin-bottom: 25px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-size: 24px;\">☁️</div>\n                                        <h3 style=\"color: #fff; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">Cloud Hosting</h3>\n                                        <p style=\"color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;\">Scalable and secure cloud infrastructure designed to grow with your business needs.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <!-- Card 2 -->\n                                    <div class=\"sv2-card\">\n                                        <div style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ec4899, #f43f5e); border-radius: 14px; margin-bottom: 25px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-size: 24px;\">🔒</div>\n                                        <h3 style=\"color: #fff; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">Cyber Security</h3>\n                                        <p style=\"color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;\">Advanced threat protection and constant monitoring to keep your assets completely secure.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <!-- Card 3 -->\n                                    <div class=\"sv2-card\">\n                                        <div style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #3b82f6); border-radius: 14px; margin-bottom: 25px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-size: 24px;\">📊</div>\n                                        <h3 style=\"color: #fff; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">Data Analytics</h3>\n                                        <p style=\"color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;\">Transform raw data into actionable insights with our powerful analytics engines.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
