                                    <div class=\"sv3-col1\">\n                                        <div class=\"sv3-card\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e 0%, #fecfef 100%);\">\n                                            <div style=\"font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">🎨</div>\n                                            <h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 10px 0;\">Branding</h3>\n                                            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.9; margin: 0;\">Identity design that leaves a lasting impression.</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"sv3-card\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6d365 0%, #fda085 100%);\">\n                                            <div style=\"font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">📱</div>\n                                            <h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 10px 0;\">App Dev</h3>\n                                            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.9; margin: 0;\">Native and cross-platform mobile solutions.</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"sv3-col2\">\n                                        <div class=\"sv3-card\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #84fab0 0%, #8fd3f4 100%);\">\n                                            <div style=\"font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">🔍</div>\n                                            <h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 10px 0;\">SEO Opt</h3>\n                                            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.9; margin: 0;\">Rank higher and get found by the right people.</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"sv3-card\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a1c4fd 0%, #c2e9fb 100%);\">\n                                            <div style=\"font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">✍️</div>\n                                            <h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 10px 0;\">Copywriting</h3>\n                                            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.9; margin: 0;\">Words that sell and tell your unique story.</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
