      "description": "Sleek list view instead of traditional grid cards",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .sv4-wrap{padding:100px 20px;font-family:sans-serif;background:#f8f9fa;}\n                          .sv4-title{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,42px);font-weight:800;color:#111;margin:0 0 50px 0;border-bottom:2px solid #111;padding-bottom:20px;}\n                          .sv4-item{display:flex;padding:40px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;align-items:flex-start;gap:40px;flex-wrap:wrap;}\n                          .sv4-num{font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,60px);font-weight:900;color:#e0e0e0;line-height:1;}\n                          .sv4-text{flex:1;min-width:250px;}\n                          @media(max-width:768px){.sv4-wrap{padding:50px 20px;} .sv4-item{padding:30px 0;gap:20px;}}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"sv4-wrap\">\n                            <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n                                <h2 class=\"sv4-title\">Our Services</h2>\n                                \n                                <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column;\">\n                                    <!-- Service Item -->\n                                    <div class=\"sv4-item\">\n                                        <div class=\"sv4-num\">01</div>\n                                        <div class=\"sv4-text\">\n                                            <h3 style=\"font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; color: #222; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">Strategy & Consulting</h3>\n                                            <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #666; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">We help you define clear goals and create actionable roadmaps to navigate the complex digital landscape and achieve sustainable growth.</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <!-- Service Item -->\n                                    <div class=\"sv4-item\">\n                                        <div class=\"sv4-num\">02</div>\n                                        <div class=\"sv4-text\">\n                                            <h3 style=\"font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; color: #222; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">Product Design</h3>\n                                            <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #666; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">From wireframes to high-fidelity prototypes, we design user-centric interfaces that are visually stunning and highly functional.</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <!-- Service Item -->\n                                    <div class=\"sv4-item\">\n                                        <div class=\"sv4-num\">03</div>\n                                        <div class=\"sv4-text\">\n                                            <h3 style=\"font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; color: #222; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">Engineering</h3>\n                                            <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #666; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Our expert developers bring designs to life using modern tech stacks, ensuring your product is fast, secure, and easily scalable.</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
